# Copy this to .env.local for local testing against a deployed backend,
# or set VITE_API_BASE_URL as an Environment Variable in your Vercel project settings.
#
# Leave this UNSET for normal local development — Vite's dev server proxy
# (see vite.config.ts) already forwards /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
#
# For production, set it to your deployed Render backend URL (no trailing slash):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-name.onrender.com
